@startuml Component Diagram - SDK
title Diagrama de Componentes — SDK Kit Pagos Colombia (Nivel 3)
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 10
skinparam titleFontSize 11
skinparam rectangleFontSize 10
skinparam ArrowFontSize 10
skinparam NoteFontSize 10
skinparam wrapWidth 190
skinparam nodesep 6
skinparam ranksep 18
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #666666
  ArrowColor #666666
  FontColor white
}

rectangle "**Desarrollador**\n\nConsume el SDK para\nintegrar pasarelas de pago" as Dev #1F4E79

rectangle "SDK Kit Pagos Colombia (Paquete npm / TypeScript)\n[container]" as System #FFFFFF;text:black {
  rectangle "**KitPagos**\n<i>[Facade Pattern]</i>\n<i>TypeScript</i>\n\nPunto de entrada unico.\ncreatePayment(),\ngetPaymentStatus(),\ngetPseBanks(),\nvalidateWebhook()" as Facade #1F4E79
  rectangle "**SDK Configurator**\n<i>[Configuration Module]</i>\n<i>TypeScript</i>\n\nGestiona pasarela\nactiva, credenciales\ny modo (produccion/\nsimulacion)" as Configurator #2E75B6
  rectangle "**Gateway Factory**\n<i>[Factory Pattern]</i>\n<i>TypeScript</i>\n\nInstancia adaptador\nsegun el enum\nGateway configurado" as Factory #2E75B6
  rectangle "**Payment Gateway Port**\n<i>[Interfaz / Puerto]</i>\n<i>TypeScript</i>\n\nContrato abstracto con\nlas operaciones que\ndebe implementar\ncada adaptador" as Port #90CAF9;text:black

  rectangle "**Response Normalizer**\n<i>[Application Service]</i>\n<i>TypeScript</i>\n\nDespacha en un\nnormalizador por\npasarela, que mapea\nestados nativos a\nTransactionStatus y\nconstruye la entidad\nTransaction" as Normalizer #2E75B6
  rectangle "**Retry Handler**\n<i>[Resilience Utility]</i>\n<i>TypeScript</i>\n\nReintentos con\nbackoff exponencial\nante errores\ntransitorios" as Retry #2E75B6
  rectangle "**Error Handler**\n<i>[Application Service]</i>\n<i>TypeScript</i>\n\nConvierte errores\nnativos en\nKitPagosError tipado\ncon KitPagosErrorCode.\nSe divide por forma\ndel error, no por\npasarela" as ErrorHandler #2E75B6
  rectangle "**Webhook Verifier**\n<i>[Domain Service]</i>\n<i>TypeScript</i>\n\nDespacha en un\nmanejador por\npasarela, que verifica\nla firma criptografica\n(SHA-256, HMAC) y\nconstruye el\nWebhookEvent" as Webhook #2E75B6
  rectangle "**Transaction Entity**\n<i>[Domain Entity]</i>\n<i>TypeScript</i>\n\nEncapsula estado\nunificado, montos,\nautorizacion y datos\ndel pagador" as Transaction #FFE0B2;text:black

  rectangle "**Wompi Adapter**\n<i>[Adapter Pattern]</i>\n\nTraduce a Wompi\n(Bearer, status)" as WompiAdapter #5B9BD5
  rectangle "**Rapyd Adapter**\n<i>[Adapter Pattern]</i>\n\nTraduce a Rapyd\n(access_key/\nsecret_key,\nHMAC-SHA256)" as RapydAdapter #5B9BD5
  rectangle "**Mercado Pago**\n**Adapter**\n<i>[Adapter Pattern]</i>\n\nTraduce a\nMercado Pago\n(Bearer,\nstatus_detail)" as MPAdapter #5B9BD5
  rectangle "**Kushki Adapter**\n<i>[Adapter Pattern]</i>\n\nTraduce a Kushki\n(Private-\nMerchant-ID)" as KushkiAdapter #5B9BD5
}

rectangle "**Wompi API**\nBancolombia\nSandbox" as WompiAPI #A9A9A9
rectangle "**Rapyd API**\nLatam Sandbox" as RapydAPI #A9A9A9
rectangle "**Mercado Pago**\n**API**\nMercado Libre\nSandbox" as MPAPI #A9A9A9
rectangle "**Kushki API**\nUAT Sandbox" as KushkiAPI #A9A9A9
rectangle "**API de Simulacion**\nSimulador desplegado\n(Render). Destino\nprincipal durante\nevaluacion" as SimAPI #808080

Dev --> Facade : Invoca operaciones\nde pago\n[TypeScript]

Facade --> Configurator : Usa entorno
Facade --> Factory : Solicita\nadapter
Facade --> Retry : Envuelve\nllamada
Facade ..> Webhook : Valida\nwebhook
Factory ..> Port : Instancia

Port <|.. WompiAdapter
Port <|.. RapydAdapter
Port <|.. MPAdapter
Port <|.. KushkiAdapter

Retry --> ErrorHandler : MAX_RETRIES_\nEXCEEDED
Normalizer --> Transaction : Construye

WompiAdapter --> WompiAPI : Nativo\n[HTTPS]
RapydAdapter --> RapydAPI : Nativo\n[HTTPS]
MPAdapter --> MPAPI : Nativo\n[HTTPS]
KushkiAdapter --> KushkiAPI : Nativo\n[HTTPS]

WompiAdapter ..> SimAPI : Modo\nsimulacion
RapydAdapter ..> SimAPI : Modo\nsimulacion
MPAdapter ..> SimAPI : Modo\nsimulacion
KushkiAdapter ..> SimAPI : Modo\nsandbox UAT

Webhook -[hidden]down- Configurator
note bottom of RapydAdapter
  Reemplaza a "PayU Adapter"
  tras la adquisicion (ver
  architecture-log.md, punto 15).
end note

note top of Normalizer
  Response Normalizer y Webhook
  Verifier son despachadores: cada
  pasarela tiene su propia
  implementacion detras de una
  interfaz (GatewayResponseNormalizer
  y GatewayWebhookHandler). No se
  dibujan como componentes aparte
  porque, a diferencia de los
  adaptadores, no hablan con ningun
  sistema externo; el detalle de
  clases esta en el Diagrama de
  Clases de la Arquitectura
  Hexagonal. Ver architecture-log.md,
  punto 34.
end note

@enduml
